OL,3,GNEWSAInternational student who raped
OL,4,Awoman jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who raped a "confused and
OL,7,Fvulnerable" student he met on a street
OL,8,Fnear his home has been jailed for nine
OL,9,Fyears.
OL,11,FUvesh Vahora, 36, who had moved to the
OL,12,FUK from India two months earlier, saw
OL,13,Fthe woman in the Hyde Park area of
OL,14,FLeeds on 9 April as she struggled to
OL,15,Funlock her front door.
OL,17,FHe was seen on CCTV leading the
OL,18,F25-year-old victim to his house, where
OL,19,Fshe recalled being taken to the
OL,20,Fbasement before he took her phone away
OL,21,Fand raped her.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
