OL,3,GNEWSAInternational student who raped
OL,4,Awoman jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt Leeds Crown Court, Judge Guy Kearle
OL,7,FKC told Vahora he "took advantage of
OL,8,Fher vulnerability to satisfy your
OL,9,Fselfish sexual desire". He said
OL,10,Falthough he could not order it,
OL,11,FVahora's deportation was an "inevitable
OL,12,Fconsequence of this sentence".
